{"title":"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 12A Problems\">2014 AMC 12A #8</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems\">2014 AMC 10A #11</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Using_The_Answers)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Using The Answers)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A customer who intends to purchase an appliance has three coupons, only one of which may be used:\n</p><p>Coupon 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56bd637cb2c936d539be1b5000a64a898af389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> off the listed price if the listed price is at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/4/f94b4cab8f57e8d3121cd9bb4de67feb31a48a73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Coupon 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/9/2a952bdac436c12f4946ae369a84e6fc40184595.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> off the listed price if the listed price is at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6a1da7f18069a90481296d18af7ca979fe3854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Coupon 3: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/0/67047f86fad1d8d66cbe70a97dbcb2e0e4e09d34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> off the amount by which the listed price exceeds <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6a1da7f18069a90481296d18af7ca979fe3854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>For which of the following listed prices will coupon <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> offer a greater price reduction than either coupon <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or coupon <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/b/1cb3170cc67a3779f3594cce7cbedf2d79939c02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\textdollar179.95\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }\\textdollar199.95\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }\\textdollar219.95\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }\\textdollar239.95\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\textdollar259.95\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"605\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the listed price be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Since all the answer choices are above <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6a1da7f18069a90481296d18af7ca979fe3854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" />, we can assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/1/681fed53ddc4b512b2acfad8135791ea6fe2e1d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />. Thus the discounts after the coupons are used will be as follows:\n</p><p>Coupon 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/6/fe6fa84e94c7e21e36c6e09dd2fe8087d63f7eea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\times10\\%=.1x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"114\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Coupon 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Coupon 3: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/c/9cc0a8e966557716654d550abd80cdb3e8ba4776.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18\\%\\times(x-100)=.18x-18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"227\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\nFor coupon <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to give a greater price reduction than the other coupons, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/3/6e393322b0b637fad4b519f687b0b29166e68380.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$.1x&gt;20\\implies x&gt;200$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"177\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/6/bd6c7c7c254babf3fc99355804a334dd1bf837ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$.1x&gt;.18x-18\\implies.08x&lt;18\\implies x&lt;225$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"359\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>The only choice that satisfies such conditions is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/0/6d0dce25aa1857785a152c79e7e8d6c81cbd6161.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\textdollar219.95}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"105\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Using_The_Answers.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Using_The_Answers)\">Solution 2 (Using The Answers)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Using The Answers)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For coupon <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to be the most effective, we want 10% of the price to be greater than 20. This clearly occurs if the value is over 200. For coupon 1 to be more effective than coupon 3, we want to minimize the value over 200, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62dad69d6db6d5c53c33f55461f9a77a5df426fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }\\textdollar219.95}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"106\" height=\"29\" /> is the smallest answer choice over 200.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since all the answer choices are above <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6a1da7f18069a90481296d18af7ca979fe3854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" />, let the price be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/7/59705814a5cadac16403d770828034d9646dfa3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$100 + x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"17\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/e/cae4fd68f44ac9b909f8d91f9d498de5759bb45b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />. Then, the discount from Coupon 1 is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a3102b50e982c67c804d2e792ecf275f99c9e5ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$10 + \\frac{x}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"73\" height=\"34\" />, the discount from Coupon 2 is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/5/555360df10d7f3448442d43c277f763b0d1236bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" />, and the discount from Coupon 3 is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/6/ca6868387bde1cc1c66e7b0cbd1ba7f8bb7afea5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{50}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"34\" height=\"38\" />. Thus we obtain the following inequalities: \n\\begin{align*}\n&amp;10 + \\frac{x}{10} &gt; 20 \\\\\n&amp;10 + \\frac{x}{10} &gt; \\frac{9}{50}x\n\\end{align*}\nSolving them, we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/1/681fed53ddc4b512b2acfad8135791ea6fe2e1d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/0/bb083d015381dc32d916dd23a30af5c8e686bb44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"64\" height=\"15\" />. Thus the price is between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/0/4a0d1ea2f817036d72f6d1449562fc3a1dfd01da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/3/803699c1eb0b60be17ea3d5822fa38d3d65f7c9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$225\\Rightarrow \\boxed{\\text{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"103\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solutions\">Video Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/aGEB3ykW1BM\">https://youtu.be/aGEB3ykW1BM</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/rJytKoJzNBY\">https://youtu.be/rJytKoJzNBY</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A\">2014 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 13\">13